      "differentiators": {
        "value": [
          "Welcome to Account-it Consulting Services, LLC, a trusted partner for comprehensive tax and accounting services based in Boynton Beach, Florida. We specialize in tax preparation and planning for both individuals and businesses, ensuring our clients navigate the complexities of the tax system with confidence. We also provide QuickBooks Online services, assisting business owners with seamless financial management solutions. While payroll services are available, they are primarily offered to existing clients or those transitioning to a tax setup that requires payroll.",
          "Choosing us means benefiting from the extensive background and hands-on experience of our founder, Doug Cohen. With a career that spans over 14 years as a CFO and controller, coupled with experience in larger public accounting firms, our founder brings a wealth of knowledge in not just accounting-related matters but also in running a business. This includes dealing with insurance, bankers, hiring and firing employees, and managing employee benefits. Doug's practical, hands-on experience across various industries makes us uniquely equipped to provide valuable insights and support to clients like you."
        ],
        "status": "extracted",
        "sources": [
