      "customerNeeds": {
        "value": [
          "Whether you're searching for tax preparation, tax planning, or QuickBooks services in Boynton Beach, Account-it Consulting Services, LLC is here to support you with expertise and personalized care. Contact us today at (954) 592-8630 or dougc@account-it.net to learn how we can help you achieve your financial goals.",
          "At Account-it Consulting Services, LLC, we have the expertise that is needed to help you file your returns while also helping you to minimize your tax liability with careful planning.",
          "helping you to defer income so that you can save money now and pay less taxes in the future",
          "Here are some links to help you learn more about taxes:",
          "Whether you are just starting your business or you would like to switch to a better system for payroll processing, we can provide the business services that you require. We can help simplify the payroll process to help you more effectively manage your Florida small business. Let us assist you with your payroll needs so that you can focus on running your business.",
          "Whether you are a start-up business, a growing business or a mature corporation, Account-it Consulting Services, LLC has the expertise to help you.",
          "Account-it Consulting Services, LLC is here to help you resolve your tax problems and put an end to the misery that the IRS can put you through. We pride ourselves on being very efficient, affordable, and, of course, extremely discrete.",
          "We can help you with the following IRS tax problems:"
