        "background": {
          "value": "CPAs are a great resource for any business, large or small. But if your accountant also has a wealth of experience in operations, HR and overall financial strategy - like I do - he can provide incredible value to your company. My experience includes years of public accounting, 14 years as a CFO/Controller, part-time CFO and, since 2003, my own accounting practice in South Florida. I provide part-time or interim financial and accounting services. You can receive the service and support of a highly qualified CFO and Controller only as you need it, without having to pay a full-time salary or benefits. Many companies offer this type of professional service -- but, all too often, professional service companies and larger CPA firms charge exorbitant fees.",
          "status": "extracted",
